{"text": "At sunrise they gathered on a hill, where the chief put his cap on the ground as the starting mark. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Pahom walked east with a spade on his shoulder, digging holes along the way to mark his land. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Whenever he thought of turning, he saw better land ahead and said, It would be a pity to lose that. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he finally turned toward the hill, it was still ten miles away, and the sun had begun to sink. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Throwing away his coat and boots, he began to run, and his heart beat like a hammer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I stopped now, they would call me a fool, he thought, so he ran on although he could hardly breathe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He reached the foot of the hill as the sun set, but up on the hilltop it was still shining. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With his last strength, he rushed up and fell forward, reaching the cap with his hands, and the chief cried, He has gained much land. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His servant ran up to lift him, but Pahom was dead, so the servant dug a grave with the spade. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Six feet from his head to his heels was all the land that he needed.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "s", "u", "n", "r", "i", "s", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "g", "a", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "a", " ", "h", "i", "l", "l", ",", " ", "w", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "h", "i", "e", "f", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "c", "a", "p", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "a", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "a", "r", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "m", "a", "r", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "P", "a", "h", "o", "m", " ", "w", "a", "l", "k", "e", "d", " ", "e", "a", "s", "t", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "s", "p", "a", "d", "e", " ", "o"